+  running turn or pending Plan approval leaves the old binding unchanged. The
+  pending read returns only the requested session's asks and permissions;
+  native Pi sessions return empty, while remote and unknown ids return
+  `NOT_FOUND` instead of data. Allow
+  once executes only that call, deny prevents execution, and the AskTool result
+  preserves plain-text values and skipped questions. The first valid resolution
+  wins; a lost acknowledgement is reconciled by re-reading and is not replayed.
