+ * another session's) set of cards, while native Pi sessions keep the empty
+ * renderer contract.
+ *
+ * The test drives the real `registerAgentIpc` callback with fake host and
+ * bridge. When a workspace dependency is unavailable in a partial checkout,
+ * the resolver below falls back to its source or a minimal stub; a complete
+ * checkout keeps using the installed packages.
+ */
